Hi,

After 2.5 years of waiting and silent bugfixing, a new radvd 
maintenance version is out: 0.7.3. :)

Get it at:  http://www.litech.org/radvd/

The most notable changes are:
  - A large number of fixes and cleanups
  - Support Router Preferences and More Specific routes
  - Add "IgnoreIfMissing" interface flag, to be used
    with interfaces which may become available only later on

Please report issues, if any, to the radvd-devel-l@litech.org mailing 
list.

Thanks!

